Description:
 ros-one-navfn - navfn provides a fast interpolated navigation function that can b
Changes:
 ros-one-navfn (1.17.3-3-g9ad64419-2025.02.09.06.38) jammy; urgency=high
 .
   * [ROS-O] various patches (#1225 <https://github.com/ros-planning/navigation/issues/1225>)
     * do not specify obsolete c++11 standard
     this breaks with current versions of log4cxx.
     * update pluginlib include paths
     the non-hpp headers have been deprecated since kinetic
     * use lambdas in favor of boost::bind
     Using boost's _1 as a global system is deprecated since C++11.
     The ROS packages in Debian removed the implicit support for the global symbols,
     so this code fails to compile there without the patch.
   * Contributors: Michael Görner
